{
  "feature": "Tuning hub, PR 1: the landing, the tool switch and the trim-line shortcut",
  "note": "Tuning hub handoff R1 canvas A (A1, A2, A4, A5, A6) plus the plan's no-reading row. Needs ANALYSIS_TAB_ENABLED, TUNING_ENABLED and PROPOSED_CUTS_ENABLED all 'true' (two tools on draws the hub), on a scratch branch holding a pull:staging copy, and three decks the signed-in account owns: HUB_OVER_DECK, a read deck since built past 100; HUB_FULL_DECK, a read deck at 100; HUB_UNREAD_OVER_DECK, a deck past 100 that was never read. A3, a run in flight on its tile, needs a pending paid run and is covered by tuning-hub.test (the running tile, its elapsed time and the re-read).",
  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "A1-landing-over",
      "label": "/decks/[id] Analysis, a read deck now over 100: four-tile landing order, Proposed cuts offered with `this deck is N over`",
      "view": "src/components/decks/tuning-hub.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/decks/${HUB_OVER_DECK}",
          "wait": "[role=tablist]",
          "settle": 1500
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "tab",
          "name": "Analysis",
          "settle": 700
        },
        {
          "wait": "[data-tuning-hub]",
          "settle": 900
        },
        {
          "scrollTo": "[data-tuning-hub]",
          "settle": 400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A2-landing-at-100",
      "label": "/decks/[id] Analysis, a read deck at 100: Proposed cuts present and inert, its reason as the purpose line",
      "view": "src/components/decks/tuning-hub.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/decks/${HUB_FULL_DECK}",
          "wait": "[role=tablist]",
          "settle": 1500
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "tab",
          "name": "Analysis",
          "settle": 700
        },
        {
          "wait": "[data-tool-tile='cuts'][data-inert]",
          "settle": 900
        },
        {
          "scrollTo": "[data-tuning-hub]",
          "settle": 400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "NR-no-reading-over",
      "label": "/decks/[id] Analysis, a deck built long and never read: the hub draws, Suggested changes inert and saying why",
      "view": "src/components/decks/tuning-hub.tsx",
      "steps": [
        {
          "goto": "/decks/${HUB_UNREAD_OVER_DECK}",
          "wait": "[role=tablist]",
          "settle": 1500
        },
        {
          "clickRole": "tab",
          "name": "Analysis",
          "settle": 700
        },
        {
          "wait": "[data-tool-tile='suggested'][data-inert]",
          "settle": 900
        },
        {
          "scrollTo": "[data-tuning-hub]",
          "settle": 400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
